Description: Reproducible pipeline that regenerates every figure and table for
    the OmniPath Metabo manuscript (main text and supplementary) from a
    pinned OmniPath Postgres snapshot. Plots are ggplot2 + tidyverse; the
    Figure 1A workflow-architecture diagram is TikZ compiled with xelatex;
    composites are assembled automatically via patchwork, LaTeX pdfpages,
    svgutils, and pdftk. See specs/001-figures-pipeline/ in the
    saezverse repository for the spec, plan, contracts, and quickstart.
